{"ts": "2026-05-20T08:30:00", "task": "dailyt", "chat": "resisres", "chat_label": "@resisres", "chat_id": -1003717332318, "thread_id": null, "msg_id": 1654, "text": "Sheinbaum on the mañanera today: \"The neoliberal model concentrated wealth and impoverished the majority. What we are building is a Mexico of the people — not just rhetoric, but redistribution. Real wages have risen 56% since 2018. Minimum wage tripled. 30 million Mexicans lifted from poverty. The mañanera itself is part of this — accountability every morning, transparency by default, the press asking what they want. No filter, no spin, no off-the-record. We do not govern for the few. We govern for the 130 million.\"", "img": "https://www.gob.mx/cms/uploads/image/file/1075434/2026-05-20_Conferencia_de_prensa_matutina_-_Palacio_Nacional_02_GM.jpg", "url": "https://t.me/resisres/1654"}
